WEBVTT

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:04.980
<b>The All-Japan Senior Little League Baseball Championship</b>

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.980
<b>The All-Japan Senior Little League Baseball Championship</b>

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.360
Game 1
begins at 10:00 AM

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.360
<b>Kuramoto Chuo</b>

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.360
<b>Fujiura</b>

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.360
Game 2
begins at 1:00 PM

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.360
6th
Final

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.360
The All-Japan Senior Little League Baseball Championship

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.360
Semifinals

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.070
<b>Fujishiro</b>

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.820
<b>Kaneko</b>

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.820
<b>Totsuka</b>

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.820
<b>Ise</b>

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:14.820
<b>Kuramoto Chuo</b>

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.820
<b>Fujiura</b>

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.590
Tomocchi! Morning!

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:02.580
Morning.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.190
What's that?

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:05.850
A bat I found at home!

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:07.910
Oh, that's good.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.330
Oh, yeah. We get to use
our club room starting today.

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:15.300
All right! I'm gonna be the first one there!

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.510
Hang on, Tsubasa!

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.940
We have classes first, remember?

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:57.030
<b>Let's Work Up a Good Sweat</b>

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:06.340
This story's a dud...
This one's no good, either!

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:09.540
I need the purrfect story for
the newspaper club's first issue!

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.620
Story!

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.150
Um...

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:16.450
Could you please refrain 
from shouting in here?

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:21.630
Anyway, this school doesn't
even have a newspaper club...

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:26.550
Club? Club...

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:29.520
The girls' hardball baseball team

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:33.490
is looking for members!

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:33.600
<b>Seeking
Members</b>

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:33.600
<b>Girls' Hardball
Baseball
Team</b>

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:34.100
<b>Seeking
Members</b>

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:34.100
<b>Girls' Hardball
Baseball
Team</b>

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:35.630
Um...

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:36.950
That's it!

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:39.900
<b>G</b>

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:40.030
<b>Girl</b>

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:40.150
<b>Girls'</b>

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:40.280
<b>Girls' Hard</b>

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:40.400
<b>Girls' Hardball</b>

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:40.530
<b>Girls' Hardball Base</b>

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:41.240
<b>Girls' Hardball Baseball</b>

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:45.260
Yes, yes, yes! Something tells me
this is going to be a huge scoop!

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:44.450
<b><u>Girls' Hardball Baseball</u></b>

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.910
<b>Girls' Hardball Baseball</b>

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:49.870
Girls' Baseball

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.610
Our very own club room!

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:55.330
Now we can change without 
worrying about being seen.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.540
We can discuss tactics in here, too.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:03:59.510
Yeah!

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:02.590
The teacher also said we can
get funding if we apply for it!

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:03.970
F-Funding?!

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.930
Now we'll be able to buy 
all the balls we need!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.590
This is really starting 
to feel like a club now.

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:10.640
Right?

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:14.120
There's lots of gear we still need.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:17.360
We must put some serious thought 
into how we will use our funds.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.600
You're right.

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:20.730
We'll need balls, helmets...

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:24.410
Well, we can think about all that later.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.300
We already have some gear,

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:28.700
so let's go start practice!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.160
Practice?

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:32.410
I thought you might say that...

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.880
...so I came up with a regimen.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:36.210
Amazing!

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.670
You're the best, Suzuki-san!

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.040
We'll start off with a jog.

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:44.510
Next, sprinting.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:54.670
A-And after that, defensive drills.

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:55.520
Okay!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.480
Here!

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:02.860
Here it comes!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:06.990
Got it!

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.410
There!

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.330
There!

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:14.200
There.

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:18.460
Wait up...

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:20.920
Yes!

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.760
Okay... next on the list is...

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:29.890
a break.

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:31.850
Thank goodness...

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.960
This is pretty tough.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:37.810
I should... rethink this regimen...

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:40.770
Practice is so much fun!

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:44.190
Here I go!

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.440
Hurrah!

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:53.320
Hurrah!

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:55.870
What's that about?

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.230
Girls' baseball!

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:59.830
Go, go, girls' baseball!

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:05.150
No guts, no glory! You gotta dig in!

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:10.810
I'll cheer you on till practice is over.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:13.010
You just give it your all!

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.530
Um, and you would be...

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:16.480
Who, me?

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.940
As you can probably tell,
I'm on the cheer squad!

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:21.900
Satogahama High School 
second-year, Iwaki Yoshimi!

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:25.830
When a team is practicing to
the west of me, I cheer them on.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:29.780
When a team is losing to the east, 
I encourage them to never give up!

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:30.990
Uh-huh, uh-huh.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.910
Oh, she's a second-year.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:38.620
Listen up! I'm gonna cheer on your girls'
baseball association every step of the way!

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:44.270
If you've already scheduled
any games, let me know.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:46.290
After all, I get pretty busy.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:47.580
Games?

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.020
We can't play in any games.

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:53.640
Baseball games require nine on a team,
and we only have five members.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.850
Oh... That's so sad.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:02.060
Hey, Iwaki-senpai, would you mind 
helping us recruit more members?

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.180
Help you recruit, huh?

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:07.490
Yes, I guess that's one way to support you.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:09.280
All right, I'll do it!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:10.990
Thank you so much!

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.950
So what kinda people are you looking for?

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:17.710
Girls who are into baseball!

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:21.980
I think most don't even know
all that much about baseball...

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:24.120
Girls who have been in
athletic clubs before, then?

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.450
G-Girls who run fast?

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:28.170
Right...

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.310
Oh, this is so irritating!

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.640
Forget it! I'll pick them myself!

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:38.870
I didn't know there were girls
like her in the grades above.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:41.000
She seemed really powerful...

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:44.810
But having someone cheering us on
brings a smile to my face.

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:47.770
Hey!

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:49.730
I got one for ya!

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:50.690
That was fast!

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:53.290
This is Asada Aoi, a second-year!

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:54.660
Hi there.

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:00.970
Wow, you really <i>do</i>
have a girls' baseball team.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.330
Hey! You're the first-year
I've heard so much about!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.420
Huh? Wh-Who, me?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:10.360
I heard you ticked off the student 
council president on your first day.

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:14.930
Do you know a lot about baseball?

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:17.310
Not a thing!

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:18.380
Huh?

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:22.600
Aoi's amazing, though!
She's the best gambler in school!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.060
Gambler?

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:29.020
Yeah! I've never beaten her, not even once!

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:31.640
First out is rock!

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:33.280
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.450
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:39.200
Scissors!

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:40.160
Scissors!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:40.920
See?

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:43.120
That's what you meant by "a gambler"?

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:46.080
That's amazing! I wanna play you, too!

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:48.040
Ready whenever you are.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:50.730
You're pretty fearless, aren't ya?

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:52.510
I won't lose!

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.910
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:01.640
That's incredible! You tied with Aoi!

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.770
I didn't win, though...

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:06.600
What are you saying?
Most people flat-out lose!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.570
<i>This girl's... got something!</i>

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:12.280
So... will you be joining?

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:15.260
I'll join for the time being.

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:17.370
This seems kinda fun.

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:19.200
That gives us six!

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.330
No, make it seven.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.370
Huh? Me, too?!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:26.940
The captain of the cheer squad 
can't turn down a request!

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:33.960
All right! I'll join, too!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:35.420
Really?

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:39.600
As long as you don't mind that
I'll still be on the cheer squad, too.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.180
Of course, that's fine!

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:46.660
Tomocchi, we'll have to
celebrate on our way home!

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.370
Celebrate?

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.520
So good!

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:55.530
I know! But... this is what 
you meant by "celebrate"?

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:58.190
Well, I was hungry.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:01.500
Ooh, I got an extra slice of pork!

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:02.910
See?

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:05.850
Good luck follows her everywhere!

00:10:07.010 --> 00:10:07.990
Suspicious...

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:10.830
Here are your pork buns.

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:12.930
And here's your special fried rice.

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:14.310
It's here!

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:15.540
Enjoy.

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:21.120
Nakano-san.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:23.930
Oh, Nakano-san! What a coincidence.

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:27.640
It's no coincidence.
She's been following us the whole time.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:28.370
Huh?

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:33.610
Urk! I've done it now!
I'm a disgrace to journalists everywhere!

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:37.340
In-depth coverage?

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:42.320
Yep! I was hoping to write about 
your team for the school paper.

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:45.540
Why? There are plenty of other clubs.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:49.250
High school girls playing with hard baseballs
is a treasure trove of dreams!

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:55.120
Up until recently, there weren't any
high schools with a girls' baseball team.

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:57.170
Middle schools and universities had them,

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:58.920
but for some reason, no high schools did.

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:01.130
Wow, really?

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:02.390
You didn't know?

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:05.850
So high school girls could
only play for club teams,

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:13.020
or play on boys' teams, where they
couldn't play in official games.

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:18.800
Then, in 1995, a friendly game
using hardballs was organized,

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:21.740
<b>Fussa Municipal Fussa Baseball Field</b>

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:21.740
pitting a team of high school girls
against a team from abroad.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:27.720
That spawned the idea of holding
a national tournament for high school girls.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:32.550
Then, little by little, girls' baseball
teams started popping up.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:37.630
There are currently around 
30 schools in the league.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.270
More and more girls have gone pro, too.

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:43.090
But it's still only 30 schools.

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:46.690
Girls' baseball has only
just started catching on,

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:49.060
and I'm going to make it 
even more widespread!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:52.270
Gold like this makes me
feel lucky I'm a journalist!

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:55.370
I'm totally feeling your passion right now!

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:57.940
I gladly accept your proposal
to do a feature on us!

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.740
It might help us recruit new members, too.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.200
That's what I wanted to hear!

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:05.700
Speaking of baseball,
there are some batting cages near here.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.470
Oh, that's right! There are!

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:10.120
What are batting cages like?

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:11.730
You don't know?

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:16.610
Let's go there! After all,
seeing is... um... something or other!

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:18.090
I think you mean...

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:20.750
"Seeing is believing."

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:26.930
I used to come to these
batting cages all the time!

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:30.020
Same. I was only accompanying
my brother, though.

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:31.490
Outta the park, bro!

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:35.560
Dammit!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:37.290
Keep your eye on the ball.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.690
I know!

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:41.650
They look like... they're having fun.

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:45.610
He must have played on a youth team.

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:47.540
Just like you did, Tsubasa!

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:50.590
Yeah, maybe.

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:51.510
Um...

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:55.010
Nakano-san mentioned
club teams earlier.

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:57.660
Girls can play baseball there too, right?

00:12:57.660 --> 00:13:00.590
Sure, if they're good enough.

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:12.020
Go for it, Tomocchi!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:13.480
All right...

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.900
Huh? I missed...

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:18.810
Watch the ball until the very last second.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.860
Until the very last second...

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.970
If it's a fastball, I just 
need to get the timing right.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.740
<b>Left
Field
Hit</b>

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.870
One more.

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:40.460
I did it!

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:43.920
What?

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.380
<i>That can't be right...</i>

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:51.470
I can predict them now!

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:55.180
<b>Left
Field
Hit</b>

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.850
<b>Left
Field
Hit</b>

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.870
Bring it on!

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.100
I can't hit it at all.

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.340
Try it this way.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:31.100
Try standing like this.

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:33.640
Like... this?

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:35.960
Yeah, that's it!

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.450
Then, you just have to
pump yourself up to hit it!

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:39.890
P-Pump myself up?

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.020
<b>Left
Field
Hit</b>

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.020
<b>Right
Field
Hit</b>

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:47.400
Hit it!

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:57.170
You did it!

00:14:57.170 --> 00:14:59.160
So how do you feel after your first hit?

00:14:59.160 --> 00:14:59.960
Huh?

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.920
Happy... I think...

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.210
Uh-huh, uh-huh...

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:08.090
Nakano-san, why don't you give it a go?

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:08.920
Huh?

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.640
You'll understand more if you
taste that feeling for yourself!

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:14.910
Is this right?

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:18.500
Yeah, that's great! Now, just stay focused.

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:21.440
And pump myself up, right?

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.110
I took notes earlier.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:26.270
You're one shrewd journalist. Go for it!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:30.030
I'm gonna hit it!

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:33.910
<b>Right
Field
Hit</b>

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:36.210
I hit it!

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:37.830
Great job!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.650
So how did it feel?

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:42.780
Um...

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:45.500
It felt great!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:47.030
Doesn't it?

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:48.270
Darn...

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:49.010
One more.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.220
I did it!

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:58.190
I see...

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:00.590
Okay! I'll try one more, too!

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:02.810
Yeah! That's the spirit!

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:17.460
Arihara-san, I don't think I can hit it.

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:19.060
Could you show me how again?

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:20.100
Okay!

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:23.070
Like this, see? Tighten your arms.

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:24.840
L-Like this?

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:27.150
Yeah! Now, just pump yourself up!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.140
Wow...

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:51.250
I think she's...

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:52.310
I'm gonna...

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:54.170
I'm gonna go hit some, too!

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:56.570
Arihara-san!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:39.940
So cool...

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:41.950
This smells like a scoop!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.710
Arihara-san really is incredible!

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:54.210
Isn't she? Tsubasa's always 
been amazing at baseball.

00:18:17.940 --> 00:18:20.840
So you're Shinonome-san, 
right? From Class 5?

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:22.700
That was some amazing batting!

00:18:23.670 --> 00:18:24.610
Was it?

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:26.830
Hey, would you be—

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:27.580
You think...

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:31.450
...baseball is just a game now, don't you?

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:32.130
Huh?

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:36.100
I was sure we'd get to face each other again.

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:39.050
I can't believe you
decided to play pretend.

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.870
I have to go.

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:48.600
What's <i>her</i> problem?
What did she mean by "play pretend"?

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:49.860
Now, now...

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:52.610
That girl...

00:18:54.590 --> 00:19:00.700
<b>Girls' Baseball Association!</b>

00:18:54.590 --> 00:19:00.700
Remember to knock!

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:58.840
Take a look at this!

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:00.700
I got a real scoop!

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:02.820
Nakano-san, when did you do this?

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:04.870
I found it last night.

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:09.290
It's the semifinal game of the All-Japan
Senior Little League Championship!

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:10.820
Is that...

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:13.580
Yep! It's Shinonome-san, 
the girl from yesterday!

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:15.250
And this here is...

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:18.200
Arihara-san!

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:20.590
That brings back memories.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.440
You're Shinonome-san, right?
From Kuramoto Chuo Senior?

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:32.650
I was at Fujiura Senior...

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:35.610
I never thought we'd end up 
in the same high school.

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:39.550
You came to a high school 
without a baseball team too, huh?

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:42.130
I intend to join a club team.

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:44.390
One that competes at the highest level.

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:47.380
I have a tryout this weekend.

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:48.410
I see.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:54.040
What about you?

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.980
Oh, I'm having lots of fun!

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:58.690
The other girls are newbies,
but I think they can...

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:03.050
I can't fathom why you'd play pretend
with a bunch of first-timers.

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:05.070
That's...

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:07.420
Or...

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:11.940
Did you not take that game seriously, either?

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.550
Th-That's not...

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.860
Not that it matters.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:22.030
You're wasting your time if you're
here to ask me to join your team.

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:28.450
I'm aiming at going pro.
I don't have time to mess around.

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:36.170
In other words, Arihara Tsubasa won
a national Senior Little League tournament!

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:38.610
She won a national tournament?

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:40.800
I knew there was more to her than she let on.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:44.550
Kawakita-san, why did Arihara-san
start a baseball team here

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:46.300
instead of joining a club team?

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.190
Huh?

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:49.630
It's been eating at me.

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:53.480
She seems good enough
to play for a club team.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:56.390
Well... um...

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.420
Arihara, coming in!

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:05.990
What? What's going on?

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:13.430
I was in the All-Japan Senior Little League
tournament last summer.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:17.080
In the semifinal game...

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:20.380
<b>The All-Japan Senior Little League Baseball Championship</b>

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:25.760
Strike! You're out!

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:40.660
In truth, we were losing.

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:41.550
But...

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.740
I want to keep playing.

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:51.200
Kuramoto Chuo

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:51.200
Fujiura

00:21:54.840 --> 00:21:55.640
I still...

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:20.060
<b>Next Time</b>

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:20.060
<b>Though We May Stand at a Crossroads</b>
